From: z23 <3616196+z23@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Experimental default-off VA observer pause/retain (no production default)

Companion omarchy-m1-video #95. Pause/retain before bind. Drain uses
wait_completed_locked(ctx->submitted, deadline). Receipt generations come
from enable/create. Bind/teardown consult retain.

--- a/src/v4l2_request.h	2026-09-18 00:57:30.370422166 +0000
